# Supabase project credentials.
# Both of these are PUBLIC/safe for the frontend bundle — Supabase's anon key
# is designed to be exposed to clients and relies on Row Level Security (RLS)
# policies (see supabase/schema.sql) to restrict data access.
#
# Never put the Supabase `service_role` key here or anywhere in frontend code.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
